==Russian==

===Etymology===
{{inh+|ru|orv|стѧгъ}}, which is most probably from {{der|ru|non|stǫng}} (whence {{cog|en|stang}} and {{cog|da|stang}}). Compare {{m|ru|шта́нга}}, from {{cog|de|Stange}}. Alternative reconstructions point towards {{inh|ru|sla-pro|*stěgъ}} which was limited to South Slavic languages. Cognate with {{cog|be|сцяг}} and {{cog|uk|стяг}}.

